ShareVaultCancelTest
├── given cancelDeposit
│   ├── given the caller has no pending deposit
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── given the deposit belongs to a settled epoch
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── given the deposit is in the open epoch
│       └── it should refund the USDC and clear the request
└── given cancelRedeem
    ├── given the caller has no pending redemption
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given the caller has a pending redemption
        └── it should return the escrowed shares and clear the request
